+# HARD-03 selftest: deliberate GitHub Actions expression-injection sink (CWE-094)
+# to trip CodeQL's `actions` default query `actions/code-injection/medium`
+# (DELETE post red-run capture). This is a SCRATCH, throwaway workflow file —
+# it is NEVER wired into ci.yml, release.yml, or codeql.yml, and its own
+# `issue_comment` trigger is never expected to fire in practice (selftest
+# scratch branches never receive issue-comment activity). CodeQL's `actions`
+# extractor statically analyzes every workflow file's YAML definition on the
+# push that triggers codeql.yml itself — it does not require this workflow's
+# own trigger to actually fire for the vulnerable pattern to be flagged.
+# See scripts/ci-selftest/README.md / scripts/ci-selftest/codeql-actions.patch.
+
+name: ci-selftest-actions-scratch
+
+on:
+  issue_comment:
+    types: [created]
+
+permissions:
+  contents: read
+
+jobs:
+  echo-body:
+    runs-on: ubuntu-latest
+    steps:
+      - run: |
+          echo '${{ github.event.comment.body }}'
